<title>USA: Pan Am to enter Chicago with daily flights.</title>
<headline>Pan Am to enter Chicago with daily flights.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pan Am Corp said Tuesday its Pan American World Airways will begin offering twice-daily service to Chicago's Midway Airport starting March 1.</p>
<p>The service will link Miami and San Juan to Chicago-Midway Airport.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
